# Round-wire calibration

Miao Yuxuan · Huainan Normal University. SI; exp(+j omega t); RMS. The 2 mm wire is the Q1 calibration.

```wl
projectRoot = NestWhile[DirectoryName, NotebookDirectory[], !FileExistsQ[FileNameJoin[{#, "pyproject.toml"}]] && DirectoryName[#] =!= #&];
Get[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, "models", "analytic", "src", "Q1Analytical.wl"}]];
p = Import[FileNameJoin[{projectRoot, "configs", "reference_parameters.json"}], "RawJSON"];
r = LitzAnalytical`RoundWireSolution[p];
KeyTake[r, {"Rac_ohm_per_m", "loss_W_per_m"}]

ListLinePlot[r["profile"][[All, {1, 4}]], Frame -> True, FrameLabel -> {"r (m)", "|J| (A/m^2 RMS)"}]
```
